  "display_title": "[Office Anthology] This Isn't Why I Joined the Company",
  "description": "*“I asked if I could take her place tonight.”*\n\nHearing Hong Na-Bin, whom he'd always thought of as just a “little girl”, speak so boldly, Kang Tae-Ho's jaw dropped. This was a clear provocation. What does it matter if she's barely a handful? Even setting that aside, she didn't seem the type to blurt out something like this.\n\n *“Stop talking nonsense and go home to eat.”*\n\nHe waved his hand dismissively, but she took a step closer instead.\n\n *“By any chance, sir, do I not look like a woman to you?”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Office Danpyeonseon (오피스 단편선) Collection.*",
